# Trivy ignore file — CVEs reviewed and accepted for this PoC
# These are Go standard library CVEs embedded in the Gitea binary.
# They require Gitea upstream to rebuild with a newer Go compiler version.
# They are tracked and will be re-evaluated when a new Gitea image is released.

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.22.7+ rebuild by Gitea upstream
CVE-2024-34156

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.23.12+ / 1.24.6+ rebuild
CVE-2025-47907

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.24.8+ rebuild
CVE-2025-58183

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.24.11+ rebuild
CVE-2025-61729

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.24.12+ rebuild
CVE-2025-61726
CVE-2025-61728

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.25.8+ rebuild
CVE-2026-25679

# golang stdlib — requires Go 1.24.13+ rebuild
CVE-2025-68121

# golang.org/x/crypto — DoS in SSH key exchange, SSH not exposed in this deployment
CVE-2025-22869

# golang.org/x/oauth2 — memory exhaustion in JWS token parsing
CVE-2025-22868

# golang.org/x/image — only triggered by malicious image files, low risk in Gitea context
CVE-2024-24792
